":46,"s":37,"a":157,"sd":null},{"k":"37:158","t":"And they have made [i.e., claimed] between Him and the jinn a lineage, but the jinn have already known that they [who made such claims] will be brought [to punishment].","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":158,"sd":null},{"k":"37:159","t":"Exalted is Allāh above what they describe,","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":159,"sd":null},{"k":"37:160","t":"Except the chosen servants of Allāh [who do not share in that sin].","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":160,"sd":null},{"k":"37:161","t":"So indeed, you [disbelievers] and whatever you worship,","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":161,"sd":null},{"k":"37:162","t":"You cannot tempt [anyone] away from Him","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":162,"sd":null},{"k":"37:163","t":"Except he who is to [enter and] burn in the Hellfire.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":163,"sd":null},{"k":"37:164","t":"[The angels say], \"There is not among us any except that he has a known position.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":164,"sd":null},{"k":"37:165","t":"And indeed, we are those who line up [for prayer].","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":165,"sd":null},{"k":"37:166","t":"And indeed, we are those who exalt Allāh.\"","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":166,"sd":null},{"k":"37:167","t":"And indeed, they [i.e., the disbelievers] used to say,","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":167,"sd":null},{"k":"37:168","t":"\"If we had a message from [those of] the former peoples,","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":168,"sd":null},{"k":"37:169","t":"We would have been the chosen servants of Allāh.\"","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":169,"sd":null},{"k":"37:170","t":"But they disbelieved in it, so they are going to know.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":170,"sd":null},{"k":"37:171","t":"And Our word [i.e., decree] has already preceded for Our servants, the messengers,","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":171,"sd":null},{"k":"37:172","t":"[That] indeed, they would be those given victory","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":172,"sd":null},{"k":"37:173","t":"And [that] indeed, Our soldiers [i.e., the believers] will be those who overcome.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":173,"sd":null},{"k":"37:174","t":"So, [O Muḥammad], leave them for a time.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":174,"sd":null},{"k":"37:175","t":"And see [what will befall] them, for they are going to see.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":175,"sd":null},{"k":"37:176","t":"Then for Our punishment are they impatient?","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":176,"sd":null},{"k":"37:177","t":"But when it descends in their territory, then evil is the morning of those who were warned.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":177,"sd":null},{"k":"37:178","t":"And leave them for a time.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":178,"sd":null},{"k":"37:179","t":"And see, for they are going to see.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":179,"sd":null},{"k":"37:180","t":"Exalted is your Lord, the Lord of might, above what they describe.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":180,"sd":null},{"k":"37:181","t":"And peace upon the messengers.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":181,"sd":null},{"k":"37:182","t":"And praise to Allāh, Lord of the worlds.","j":23,"h":46,"s":37,"a":182,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":46,"surahs":[37],"sajdah":false}